    <string name="lang_privacy_10_body">I-DevLedger isebenzisa amanyathelo okhuseleko aquka ukuqinisekisa, ukhuseleko lwesixhobo nonxibelelwano olukhuselekileyo neenkonzo eziqhagamshelweyo.\n\nAkukho nkqubo yesoftware inokuqinisekisa ukhuseleko olupheleleyo. Abasebenzisi bahlala benoxanduva lokukhusela ukufikelela kwizixhobo nakwiiakhawunti zabo.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_11_body">Ungalawula izinto ezixhaswayo ozikhethayo kwisikrini soSeto, kuquka ulwimi, izaziso noseto lokhuseleko.\n\nApho i-app ixhasa khona, iinkcukacha zeakhawunti nezeprofayile zinokuhlaziywa okanye zisuswe.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_12_body">Lo Mgaqo-nkqubo Wabucala unokuhlaziywa njengoko iDevLedger ikhula okanye iinkonzo zayo zitshintsha. Inguqulelo yamva nje iza kufumaneka kwi-app.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_13_body">Imibuzo ngalo Mgaqo-nkqubo Wabucala ingathunyelwa kwiqela lophuhliso leDevLedger.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_1_body">I-DevLedger inokuqokelela ulwazi olunika xa usenza naxa usebenzisa iakhawunti, kuquka igama lakho, idilesi ye-imeyile, iinkcukacha zeprofayile nezinto ozikhethayo kwi-app.\n\nI-app inokugcina nolwazi olwenzayo ngemisebenzi yayo, kuquka iziqwenga zekhowudi, iifolda, iithegi neerekhodi zokulandelela imali.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_2_body">I-DevLedger inokusebenzisa ukungena nge-imeyile nababoneleli bokungena kanye abafana noGoogle noGitHub.\n\nAbaboneleli bokuqinisekisa banokunika iDevLedger iinkcukacha zeakhawunti ezilinganiselweyo eziyimfuneko ukukuchonga nokukuqinisekisa. I-DevLedger ayifuni ukufikelela kwigama lakho lokugqitha leakhawunti yomnye umboneleli.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_3_body">I-DevLedger inokusebenzisa ukuqinisekiswa ngebhayometriki okanye ngePIN ukukhusela ukufikelela kwimisebenzi enolwazi olubuthathaka.\n\nUkuqinisekiswa ngebhayometriki kwenziwa ngeendlela zokhuseleko ezixhaswa sisixhobo seAndroid. I-DevLedger mayingagcini ngokuthe ngqo idatha ekrwada yeminwe okanye yobuso.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_4_body">Ulwazi lusetyenziselwa ukunika imisebenzi ye-app, ukuqinisekisa abasebenzisi, ukulawula izinto abazikhethayo, ukugcina ii-asethi zomphuhlisi, ukubonisa iirekhodi zemali, ukungqamanisa idatha nokuphucula ukuthembeka kwe-app.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_5_body">I-DevLedger iyilelwe ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-intanethi kuqala. Olunye ulwazi lunokugcinwa kwisixhobo sakho ukuze imisebenzi engundoqo ihlale ifumaneka ngaphandle koqhagamshelo lwenethiwekhi.\n\nUlwazi olukwisixhobo lunokungqamaniswa neenkonzo zelifu zeDevLedger xa uqhagamshelo lufumaneka.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_6_body">Idatha yeakhawunti neye-app inokuthunyelwa kwiREST API yeDevLedger ize igcinwe kuvimba wedatha odityaniswe nayo ukuze kungqamaniswe kwaye kufikelelwe kwiakhawunti.\n\nKufuneka kusetyenziswe amanyathelo afanelekileyo okukhusela idatha ngexesha lokuthunyelwa nokugcinwa.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_7_body">I-DevLedger inokudityaniswa neenkonzo ezifana noGoogle, GitHub neFirebase.\n\nAba baboneleli banokucubungula ulwazi olulinganiselweyo olufunekayo ukuqinisekisa, ukuthumela izaziso okanye ukwenza eminye imisebenzi edityanisiweyo. Imigaqo-nkqubo yabo yabucala isebenza kulwazi olucubungulwa zezo nkonzo.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_8_body">Xa izaziso zivuliwe, iDevLedger inokusebenzisa iFirebase Cloud Messaging ukuthumela izaziso nezikhumbuzi ze-app.\n\nIzinto ozikhethayo ngezaziso zinokutshintshwa kwisikrini soSeto lwe-app.</string>
    <string name="lang_privacy_9_body">Iirekhodi zemali ezifakwe kwiDevLedger zisetyenziselwa ukuxhasa umsebenzi we-app wokulandelela ingeniso neendleko zomntu.\n\nAbasebenzisi mabaphephe ukufaka iinkcukacha zebhanki okanye zokuhlawula ezibuthathaka ezingeyomfuneko kwiindawo zokubhala ngokukhululekileyo.</string>
