    <string name="lang_terms_10_body">Ukuqokelelwa nokuphathwa kolwazi lomntu kuchazwe ngokwahlukileyo kuMgaqo-nkqubo Wabucala weDevLedger.\n\nFunda uMgaqo-nkqubo Wabucala ngaphambi kokwenza okanye ukusebenzisa iakhawunti yeDevLedger.</string>
    <string name="lang_terms_11_body">Le miqathango inokuhlaziywa njengoko iDevLedger ikhula. Apho kufanelekileyo, inguqulelo yamva nje iza kufumaneka kwi-app.</string>
    <string name="lang_terms_12_body">Imibuzo ngale miqathango ingathunyelwa kwiqela lophuhliso leDevLedger.</string>
    <string name="lang_terms_1_body">I-DevLedger sisixhobo somphuhlisi novimba wee-asethi onceda abasebenzisi ukulawula iziqwenga zekhowudi, ii-asethi zomphuhlisi, iirekhodi zemali nezinto abazikhethayo kwi-app.\n\nI-DevLedger ngoku ingumzekelo we-app wemfundo kwaye isenokuba nemisebenzi esasaphuhliswayo.</string>
    <string name="lang_terms_2_body">Unoxanduva lokunika iinkcukacha zeakhawunti ezichanekileyo nokukhusela ukufikelela kwiakhawunti yakho.\n\nMusa ukuvumela omnye umntu ukuba asebenzise iinkcukacha zakho zokungena ngabom. Thatha amanyathelo afanelekileyo ngoko nangoko xa ukrokrela ukuba iakhawunti okanye iinkcukacha zakho zokungena zisengozini.</string>
    <string name="lang_terms_3_body">I-DevLedger inokusebenzisa ukungena nge-imeyile, iinkonzo zokungena kanye kunye nokuqinisekiswa ngebhayometriki okanye ngePIN kwisixhobo ukukhusela iakhawunti yakho nolwazi olugciniweyo.\n\nUnoxanduva lokugcina ukhuseleko olufanelekileyo kwisixhobo osisebenzisela ukufikelela kwiDevLedger.</string>
    <string name="lang_terms_4_body">Uhlala unoxanduva lolwazi olwenzayo, olulayishayo okanye olugcinayo kwiDevLedger, kuquka iziqwenga zekhowudi, iinkcukacha zoseto neerekhodi zemali.\n\nMusa ukugcina umxholo ongenamvume yokuwusebenzisa okanye owaphula imithetho esebenzayo okanye amalungelo abanye.</string>
    <string name="lang_terms_5_body">I-DevLedger mayingasetyenziselwa ukugcina, ukusasaza okanye ukulawula ngabom umxholo oyingozi, ongekho mthethweni okanye ongagunyaziswanga.\n\nMusa ukuzama ukuphazamisa i-app, iinkonzo zayo zokuqinisekisa, iREST API, uvimba wedatha, iinkonzo zongqamaniso okanye ezinye iinkqubo eziqhagamshelweyo.</string>
    <string name="lang_terms_6_body">I-DevLedger inokungqamanisa ulwazi olugcinwe kwisixhobo neenkonzo zayo zelifu xa kukho uqhagamshelo lwenethiwekhi.\n\nUngqamaniso lunokulibaziseka okanye lungafumaneki ngamanye amaxesha ngenxa yeengxaki zoqhagamshelo, ulondolozo lweenkonzo okanye iimpazamo zobugcisa.</string>
    <string name="lang_terms_7_body">Eminye imisebenzi yeDevLedger inokuxhomekeka kwiinkonzo zabanye ezifana noGoogle, GitHub neFirebase.\n\nUkusebenzisa ezi nkonzo kunokulawulwa nayimiqathango nemigaqo-nkqubo yababoneleli bazo.</string>
    <string name="lang_terms_8_body">Umsebenzi wokulandelela imali weDevLedger wenzelwe ukuba sisixhobo sokuzilungelelanisa.\n\nUlwazi oluboniswa yiDevLedger malungathathwa njengecebiso leengcali zemali, locwangciso-mali okanye lerhafu. Abasebenzisi banoxanduva lokuqinisekisa iirekhodi zabo zemali.</string>
    <string name="lang_terms_9_body">Kwenziwa iinzame ezifanelekileyo zokugcina iDevLedger ifumaneka kwaye isebenza. Kodwa ukufikelela okungaphazamisekiyo akunakuqinisekiswa.\n\nImisebenzi inokungafumaneki okwethutyana ngenxa yolondolozo, iingxaki zoqhagamshelo okanye iingxaki zobugcisa.</string>
